                <pb facs="0616" n="504" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg504"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Chargé Bliss.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-12-19"><hi rendition="#italic">December 19,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Repeat to Petropolis.</p>
                <p>Discuss with the Government to which you are accredited the subject of the
                    following aide-mémoire to-day handed its representative here: [See supra.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
